{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"store","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence11RecordStoreP","text":"RecordStore","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"consent","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV","text":"Consent","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enrichers","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers8EnricherV","text":"Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplers","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV","text":"Sampler","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"samplingSeed","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","text":"UInt64","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"now","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV","text":"Date","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Initializer","externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV5store7consent9enrichers8samplers12samplingSeed3nowACx_AA7ConsentVSgSayAA8EnricherVGSayAA7SamplerVGs6UInt64V20FoundationEssentials4DateVyYbctc11Persistence11RecordStoreRzlufc","symbolKind":"init","title":"init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L122","fileName":"Tracker.swift"},"role":"symbol"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingseed:now:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker that writes every record to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"type":"text","text":", so records survive the app ending, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" start with the ones "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"type":"text","text":" kept from earlier runs."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"store"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/RecordStore","text":"RecordStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence11RecordStoreP"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"consent"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","text":"Consent","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"enrichers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Enricher","text":"Enricher","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers8EnricherV"},{"kind":"text","text":"] = [], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"samplers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","text":"Sampler","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV"},{"kind":"text","text":"] = [], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"samplingSeed"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UInt64","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V"},{"kind":"text","text":" = .random(in: .min ... .max), "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"now"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@escaping "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@Sendable"},{"kind":"text","text":" () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Date","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV"},{"kind":"text","text":" = { Date.now })"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Where each record is kept until it is delivered.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"store"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The user’s consent, which each event’s category must have before it is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"written and delivered; ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", every event delivered, by default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"consent"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"What each event’s context gains, applied in order by the tracker’s worker.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"enrichers"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Which events, or groups of events, to keep a fraction of, decided by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s worker after the enrichers and before the store; none by default, so every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event is kept."}]}],"name":"samplers"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The seed the samplers’ decisions come from: fix it and which events are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"kept is fixed too. Drawn from the system’s random number generator once, as the tracker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is made, by default. Fix it only in tests and replays: every launch with the same seed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"makes the same decision for its first matching event, its second and so on, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fixed seed shipped to every device keeps the same events everywhere rather than the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sampler’s rate of them."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"samplingSeed"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The wall-clock time each event is stamped with when it is tracked. It runs on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracking caller’s thread, so keep it fast."}]}],"name":"now"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s worker writes each record as it reaches it, before publishing it to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", rather than a stage reading "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", which runs in the delivery’s task,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"later, perhaps after a slow batch. Given "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"consent"},{"type":"text","text":", a record is written once its category"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is granted, not while it is held, and the recovered records are gated again. The worker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes the recovered records from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"type":"text","text":" before anything tracked."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Given ","type":"text"},{"code":"samplers","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", a record they drop is never written. A record the store recovered was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sampled in the run that wrote it, so it isn’t sampled again.","type":"text"}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Enricher":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Enricher"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Enricher"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/enricher","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Enricher","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"Enricher","abstract":[{"text":"Adds to the context of each event a tracker tracks, before the record is delivered.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/records-swift.property":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The records of the events this tracker tracks, for a delivery to read."}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"records","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Records","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV7RecordsV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"records","role":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Sampler":{"title":"Sampler","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"key